# Home (pages/home): the personal sections ArchiveTune shows above the YouTube Music
# feed, their options (Settings → Content & region → Home) and the speed dial menu
# entries. Shelf titles of the feed itself come from YouTube Music.

# Section titles, in the order Home shows them. The same words name the sections in
